## ▶️ How to Compile

```text
1. Open Keil μVision
2. Create a New Project
3. Select AT89C51 / AT89S52
4. Add the C Source File
5. Build the Project
6. Generate the HEX File
```

---

## ▶️ How to Simulate

```text
1. Open Proteus
2. Place the AT89C51 Microcontroller
3. Connect Crystal Oscillator (11.0592 MHz)
4. Add Reset Circuit
5. Connect LEDs and Resistors
6. Load the HEX File
7. Run the Simulation
```

